THE MMBA HISTORICAL MUSEUM & EXPERIENCE

RUNNING
1. Install Python 3.10+
2. Open a terminal in this folder
3. Run: pip install -r requirements.txt
4. Run: python mamba_museum.py

AUDIO
Rendered ElevenLabs narration can be added to assets/audio. Name each audio file using the corresponding exhibit image stem, for example:
00_Museum_Entrance.mp3
01_The_Origins.mp3
02_The_MOLY_Standard.mp3
...
14_Mambanomics_Essay_Display.mp3

The Play Plaque Audio button opens the matching audio file in the computer's default audio player.

No internet connection is required after dependencies are installed.
